<title>UK: German inland gas oil firmer, buying slow.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil firmer, buying slow.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.8473)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     35.10/35.50     19.00/19.21   34.60/35.00</p>
<p> BREMEN		35.10/35.50     19.00/19.21   34.60/35.00</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    35.40/35.80     19.16/19.37   34.80/35.20</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   36.00/36.40     19.48/19.70   35.50/35.90</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   36.10/36.50     19.54/19.75   35.60/36.00</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  37.40/37.80     20.24/20.46   36.90/37.30</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were marked up around 40 to 50 pfennigs in line with Friday's stronger screen. East German flooding has firmed sentiment. Buying remains curbed by the strong dollar.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
